DESCRIPTION:1. Wake + water + bright light (3 min) - Bright lights on\, wa
 ter\, open blinds if it's daytime.\n2. Workout or walk (15 min) - 15-min n
 o-equipment circuit: 2-min warm-up march\, then 3 rounds of 40s on/20s off
 : jumping jacks or step-jacks\, squats\, push-ups (wall/knee ok)\, reverse
  lunges (12 min)\, then 1 min stretch.\n3. Shower + uniform (10 min)\n4. F
 irst meal + pack meals (12 min) - A real meal now\; pack 2 snacks and a me
 al for the shift.\n5. Shift check + plan sleep (5 min) - Badge\, keys\, ch
 arger. Note when you'll sleep after this shift.\n\nDefault start: 6:00 AM.
  Set it to the time you usually wake up for a shift. open the event\, tap 
 Edit\, change the start time\, then choose 'Save for Future Events' (iPhon
 e) or 'This and following events' (Google). Not medical advice. Check with
  your doctor before starting a new exercise routine. CelestialPrintCanada
